# JemaOS quota signing key — EXAMPLE / PLACEHOLDER
#
# This file is NOT a real key. The real `jemaos-quota.key` is a shared secret and
# is intentionally kept out of the repository so the project can be public.
#
# Provide the real key at build/run time in one of these ways:
#   1. Environment variable JEMAOS_QUOTA_KEY=/absolute/path/to/jemaos-quota.key
#   2. A file `resources/jemaos-quota.key` next to the sources (not committed)
#   3. In CI, write it from a repository secret before packaging.
#
# The key must be identical (byte for byte, no trailing newline used) to
# /usr/share/jemaos/quota.key inside the JemaOS image.
REPLACE_WITH_THE_REAL_JEMAOS_QUOTA_KEY
